### ============================================================
### 1. REGISTRO — POST /api/user/register
### ============================================================

### Registro correcto → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wilfred@bildyapp.com",
  "password": "444433333"
}

###

### Email inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "no-es-un-email",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Contraseña menor de 8 caracteres → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@bildyapp.com",
  "password": "123"
}

###

### Email duplicado → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@bildyapp.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ============================================================
### 2. VALIDACIÓN EMAIL — PUT /api/user/validation
### ============================================================

### Código correcto → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/validation HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "code": "425111"
}

###

### Código incorrecto → 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/validation HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "code": "000000"
}

###

### Código con menos de 6 dígitos → 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/validation HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "code": "123"
}

###

### Sin token → 401
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/validation HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456"
}


### ============================================================
### 3. LOGIN — POST /api/user/login
### ============================================================

### Login correcto → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wilfred@bildyapp.com",
  "password": "444433333"
}

###

### Contraseña incorrecta → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@bildyapp.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### Email no registrado → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "noexiste@bildyapp.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ============================================================
### 4a. DATOS PERSONALES — PUT /api/user/register
### ============================================================

### Actualizar datos → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "wilfred",
  "lastName": "smith",
  "nif": "12345678L"
}

###

### Sin nombre → 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "lastName": "García",
  "nif": "12345678A"
}

###

### Sin token → 401
PUT {{baseUrl}}/user/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "lastName": "García",
  "nif": "12345678A"
}


### ============================================================
### 4b. DATOS DE COMPAÑÍA — PATCH /api/user/company
### ============================================================

### Crear compañía nueva → 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/user/company HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Mercedes-Benz España S.A.",
  "cif": "R76543210B",
  "address": {
    "street": "Calle de la rueda",
    "number": "55",
    "postal": "28009",
    "city": "Madrid",
    "province": "Madrid"
  },
  "isFreelance": false
}

###

### Unirse a compañía existente → role pasa a guest
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/user/company HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Renault F1 Team",
  "cif": "B12345679",
  "isFreelance": false
}

###

### Sin CIF → 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/user/company HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Obras García S.L.",
  "isFreelance": false
}


